SET
  @Name_2f6fdf4b0b30 = N'Muse Ember'
SET
  @Description_2f6fdf4b0b30 = N'Meta''s smallest and cheapest Muse model, released November 9, 2026 for high-volume agentic and routing work, below Muse Spark and Muse Wonder in the lineup. Multimodal input (text, images, video, audio and PDF documents) with text output and a 1M-token context window. Served as muse-ember-1.0 on the paid Meta Model API and in Muse Code, and listed on OpenRouter as meta/muse-ember. Meta Model API list price is $0.10/1M input and $0.50/1M output with cache reads at $0.004/1M; above 200,000 input tokens the request is rebilled at $0.30/$1.50. As with MJ''s other Meta Muse records there is no Meta first-party driver, so the only inference route modelled is OpenRouter, and per the routine''s standing decision 4 OpenRouter routes carry no cost row. Sources: https://openrouter.ai/meta/muse-ember ; https://models.litellm.ai/models/muse-ember-1.0 ; https://artificialanalysis.ai/models/muse-ember'
