  @Comments_65b410843e93 = N'Qwen 3.7 Plus pricing on Alibaba Cloud Model Studio (DashScope/Bailian) as of GA on 2026-06-01: $0.40/1M input, $1.16/1M output. Positioned at roughly 1/6 the per-token cost of Qwen 3.7 Max. Sources: https://www.marktechpost.com/2026/06/02/alibabas-qwen-team-launches-qwen3-7-plus-adding-vision-deep-reasoning-tool-invocation-and-autonomous-iteration-on-the-bailian-platform/ ; https://www.digitalapplied.com/blog/qwen-3-7-plus-alibaba-multimodal-agent-model-2026-release CORRECTED 2026-11-23: the output price recorded here was $1.16, which is a digit transposition of the $1.60 list price. Alibaba Cloud Model Studio lists qwen3.7-plus at $0.40/1M input and $1.60/1M output for the standard 0-256K input tier (excluding limited-time promotions), with $4.80/1M output on the 256K-1M tier; aggregators showing $1.28 reflect a time-limited 20% discount on the alias, not list. Input price was already correct. The paired OpenRouter row is deliberately left as-is per the routine''s standing decision 4 (OpenRouter prices are not tracked). Source: https://docs.modelstudio.console.alibabacloud.com/en/model-studio/qwen3-7-plus'
