SET
  @UserQuestion_ff2670e46853 = N'Lock this training pipeline so no other publish of it can run until my transaction ends, or tell me at once that another publish holds it.'
SET
  @Description_ff2670e46853 = N'Takes an update lock on one MJ: ML Training Pipelines row for the rest of the caller''s transaction, serialising every publish of that pipeline. NOWAIT: when another transaction holds the lock it fails at once, and the Predictive Studio lifecycle gate waits up to 30 s by retrying.'
SET
  @SQL_ff2670e46853 = N'-- Predictive Studio publish gate: lock one training pipeline row for the rest of the caller''s transaction.
--
-- LifecycleGate runs this through RunQuery inside its transaction, before it reads the incumbent
-- and re-verifies a publish (D-020). UPDLOCK + HOLDLOCK hold an update lock on the pipeline row (and
-- the key range, so a missing ID is locked too) until commit or rollback, which serialises every
-- publish of one pipeline. NOWAIT never waits: a held lock raises SQL Server error 1222 at once, and
-- the lifecycle gate waits up to 30 s by retrying on 1222 with backoff before it refuses
-- publish-in-progress (transient; D4-91). Returns one row when the pipeline exists, none otherwise.
-- SQL Server only (D-057).
SELECT ID
FROM [${flyway:defaultSchema}].MLTrainingPipeline WITH (UPDLOCK, HOLDLOCK, NOWAIT)
WHERE ID = {{ PipelineID | sqlString }}
'
SET
  @TechnicalDescription_ff2670e46853 = N'SELECT ID FROM MLTrainingPipeline WITH (UPDLOCK, HOLDLOCK, NOWAIT) WHERE ID = PipelineID. Must run inside the caller''s transaction on the caller''s provider: the update and key-range locks are held until commit or rollback (a missing ID is range-locked too and returns no row). NOWAIT never waits: a held lock raises SQL Server error 1222 immediately; the lifecycle gate (LockPipelineAndModel) waits up to 30 s by retrying on 1222 with backoff, then refuses publish-in-progress (transient; D4-91). Single statement, as the platform''s safety gate requires. SQL Server only (D-057).'
