      [ID]
    FROM
      [${flyway:defaultSchema}].[QueryCategory]
    WHERE
      LOWER([Name]) = LOWER(N'Predictive Studio')
  )
SET
  @UserQuestion_b9f90b19a2fc = N'Lock this model and tell me its current status, so I can check it is still in the state I expect before I change it, or tell me at once that another transition holds it.'
SET
  @Description_b9f90b19a2fc = N'Takes an update lock on one MJ: ML Models row for the rest of the caller''s transaction and returns its Status; the Predictive Studio lifecycle gate refuses a transition unless it equals the expected from-state. NOWAIT: a held lock fails at once, and the lifecycle gate waits up to 30 s by retrying.'
SET
  @SQL_b9f90b19a2fc = N'-- Predictive Studio publish gate: lock one model row and read its current Status.
--
-- LifecycleGate runs this through RunQuery inside its transaction, after the pipeline lock for a
-- publish, and refuses the transition unless the returned Status equals the expected "from" state.
-- UPDLOCK + HOLDLOCK hold an update lock on the model row until commit or rollback, so no other
-- gate transition of this model interleaves. NOWAIT never waits: a held lock raises SQL Server
-- error 1222 at once, and the lifecycle gate waits up to 30 s by retrying on 1222 with backoff
-- before it refuses publish-in-progress (transient; D4-91).
-- Returns one row when the model exists, none otherwise. SQL Server only (D-057).
SELECT Status
FROM [${flyway:defaultSchema}].MLModel WITH (UPDLOCK, HOLDLOCK, NOWAIT)
WHERE ID = {{ ModelID | sqlString }}
'
SET
  @TechnicalDescription_b9f90b19a2fc = N'SELECT Status FROM MLModel WITH (UPDLOCK, HOLDLOCK, NOWAIT) WHERE ID = ModelID. Must run inside the caller''s transaction on the caller''s provider, after the pipeline lock for a publish (D-020): the update and key-range locks are held until commit or rollback, so no other gate transition of the model interleaves. NOWAIT never waits: a held lock raises SQL Server error 1222 immediately; the lifecycle gate (LockPipelineAndModel) waits up to 30 s by retrying on 1222 with backoff, then refuses publish-in-progress (transient; D4-91). Returns one row when the model exists, none otherwise. Single statement. SQL Server only (D-057).'
SET
  @Status_b9f90b19a2fc = N'Approved'
